  "records": {
    "description": "A full feature splitter, largely a re-wire of Optics.",
    "features": [
      "Locally clocked for reliable empty box collection.",
      "Unstackable separation.",
      "As pausable as a splitter can be.",
      "In-slice distribution readout.",
      "Locks all hoppers with inventories at idle."
    ],
    "notes": "- Box collection is not guaranteed when paused. This is effectively impossible with dueling hoppers anyway. \n- Technically, inputting a massive amount of boxes with unstackables can cause items to despawn. The fix would be having 4x hopperspeed unstackable/box filters. This issue exists on every splitter with global unstackable/box sorting and has never happened in survival.",
    "compatibility": "Designed in 26.3"
  },
